---
// The page's scrollbar: a thin thumb on the right edge, in place of the browser's own (hidden in
// site.css). It shows while the page scrolls and when the pointer is near it, and it can be dragged.
// Decorative for assistive technology: the page still scrolls with the wheel, touch and the keys.
// The behaviour is initScrollbar in site.ts.
---

<div class="scrollbar" data-scrollbar aria-hidden="true" hidden>
  <div class="scrollbar__thumb"></div>
</div>
